# FIELD COVERAGE STATUS -- the only place a field of qa/field-inventory.json may be declared
# anything other than MISSING.
#
# Owner's ruling, 2026-08-13: "good fix it all. IR completion is key. we say we dont leave things
# on floor, its our differentiator. needs to be solid"
#
# THREE STATES PER FIELD, and there is no fourth:
#
#   <field-id> = carried <test_fn>          the field survives the hop, and THIS TEST FAILS IF IT
#                                           STOPS. The gate checks the function exists.
#   <field-id> = waived <YYYY-MM-DD> <why>  deliberately not carried, with a reason a customer
#                                           could read
#   (absent from this file)                 MISSING -- and MISSING is pinned in
#                                           qa/field-coverage.missing, which fails the build when
#                                           it changes in EITHER direction
#
# WHY `carried` MUST NAME A TEST.
# Because "the IR has a member for it" is not coverage. The audit ran a mutation pass over all six
# writers -- renamed eight emitted keys -- and every single one was caught, while audio
# attachments, usage sub-buckets and citation offsets were being dropped in silence. You cannot
# mutate a field that is never read and never emitted. So the claim that a field survives is only
# admissible with an instrument attached to it, and the gate refuses a `carried` line whose named
# test does not exist.
#
# WHY A WHOLE-BODY ROUND TRIP MAY BACK MANY FIELDS.
# `roundtrip_fidelity_tests` asserts an EXACT divergence set on a rich body: every field present in
# that body is proven to survive read -> write, and any new divergence fails. So one test name
# legitimately backs every field its fixture carries. It does NOT back a field the fixture omits --
# adding a field to a status line without adding it to a fixture is the way to lie here, and the
# reviewer's job is to check the fixture.
#
# FORMAT, following qa/method-coverage.status, which is this file's precedent:
#   - One entry per line. EXACT field ids only. No globs -- a wildcard is how a whole surface
#     disappears in one line.
#   - `#` comments and blank lines ignored.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ANTHROPIC -- request. Backed by `roundtrip_anthropic_request`, whose fixture carries text,
# image, document, tool_use and tool_result blocks plus every sampling knob below, and asserts the
# divergence set is EXACTLY {model}.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
anthropic/request/model = waived 2026-08-13 set by the engine from the routing lane (proxy/wire.rs set_model), not by the reader/writer pair
anthropic/request/messages[].role = carried roundtrip_anthropic_request
anthropic/request/messages[].content = carried roundtrip_anthropic_request
anthropic/request/system = carried roundtrip_anthropic_request
anthropic/request/max_tokens = carried roundtrip_anthropic_request
