# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPENAI (Chat Completions) -- 1.6.x field-carry sweep. See
# crates/busbar-llm/src/openai_chat/tests/field_carry_tests.rs; each test asserts every
# field it backs individually. Provider-specific request fields ride `extra` (lossless
# same-protocol, cleared cross-protocol); provider-specific RESPONSE fields with no addable
# IR carrier survive the same-protocol verbatim relay and drop on cross-protocol re-serialize.
